{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：13:42 2026-10-17 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"「嘉應高昇」未能追越排一檔起步的史卓豐坐騎「動心」，僅能跑獲亞軍，季軍則是麥道朗坐騎「早麗星」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl_square/47297318c13ab1e319e0416319f5090d/2026-10/20261017_The_Everest_P1.jpg\"/>\n<p>目前全球評分最高的香港馬王「嘉應高昇」，今日在澳洲悉尼蘭域馬場出戰一級賽珠穆朗瑪峰錦標（千二米），力爭衛冕這場全球最高獎金的草地賽事。</p>\n<p>今仗「嘉應高昇」排第十一檔起步，由於檔位較外，早段在潘頓胯下未能貼欄領放，轉彎亦要走出大外疊，末段雖然發力追趕，結果仍未能追越排一檔起步的史卓豐坐騎「動心」，僅能跑獲亞軍，季軍則是麥道朗坐騎「早麗星」。</p>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c45aa576b8aca83e8d84a3afe5bb1866/2026-10/5_7_1.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4f80d5bb309005050cc405023def0056/2026-10/6_7_1.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/9a5e9dc0fc0b4fcac1313b2e6464ac5c/2026-10/7_7_0.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d60dce5f9aee731f6447b2b202e13fff/2026-10/8_3.jpg\"/>\n<p>近日悉尼的不穩定天氣，令蘭域馬場的場地狀況令人顧慮；雖然當地今午出太陽，臨場掛黏地至軟地牌，但也未能助馬王「嘉應高昇」成功衛冕，其連勝紀錄亦告中斷，未能達成廿二連勝，暫時一級賽頭馬數目仍維持在九場。</p>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/542ccdd3d82896e505f7c33be671c2f7/2026-10/20261017_The_Everest_P2.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/62e9bb64288fa271035aeff62862a161/2026-10/20261017_The_Everest_P3.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/daaaae2967de5ecb38bdf998072df2b5/2026-10/20261017_The_Everest_P4_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/80a3300afebd3ddf78fe4a03dd88e065/2026-10/20261017_The_Everest_P5.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T08:19:42.835431+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":295,"images":9,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T05:42:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T12:57:57.961050+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T08:17:49.487804+00:00","content_hash":"e2c8cc98653d718e475b859f75a57e9f0a21662d9a6bd46f47e381aa41607b1b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}